WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.000
It's Mahayana V, right?

2
00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:05.000
You don't realize it's nothing at all.

3
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:08.000
It's nothing, I cry and don't cry.

4
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:12.000
That man said it was nothing.

5
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:15.000
It's nothing, I said.

